Package: wally
Version: 0.2.1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: SONGOKU00mjk <songokubesto@outlook.com>
Installed-Size: 4980
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/SONGOKU00mjk/WALLY
Description: minimal Wayland wallpaper setter
 wally sets a wallpaper on every output of a wlr-layer-shell
 compositor (Sway, Hyprland, river, niri, Wayfire, labwc, KDE
 Plasma), with first-class animated GIF and WebP support. It
 also rotates directories, fades between wallpapers, and can
 serve a control daemon.
